<%# Tovitu brand lockup for standalone authentication pages (Login, Sign Up,
    password reset, verification, check-email).
    Renders the official logo mark + "Tovitu" wordmark — the same mark used in
    the navbar/sidebar (Playground Standard, DESIGN.md §6 "use the multi-color
    logo as a signature element"). The logo SVG is decorative (aria-hidden,
    consistent with shared/logo usage); the wordmark is real text.
    Brand accent here is purple (primary) by default: these pages are
    role-agnostic shared flows. Role-specific pages (individual/shelter login)
    color their own accents with their role palette instead. %>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 mb-6">
  <%= render "shared/logo", class_name: "w-14 h-14" %>
  <p class="font-display text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-primary-600">Tovitu</p>
</div>
